# Context budget

- Follow `AGENTS.md`. Read `docs/STATUS.md` before listing or grepping the repo.
- Do not re-read chat history. Prior decisions are in `docs/LOG.md` and `docs/detection.md`.
- Do not open `Synthetic Data/GEN-*`, `PLANT-*` CSVs or PNGs, or `component-symbols/**/*.png` unless the user names that plant or file.
- Open `plan.md` only for experiment design, metrics, or the write-up.
- After a state change, update `docs/STATUS.md` and append one line to `docs/LOG.md`.
